@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health: 200 Healthy with the database running, 503 Unhealthy with it stopped
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Catalog categories: 200 with the 5 seeded categories, no login needed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/categories

### Catalog products of "Combos" (seed id): 200 with 4 products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/products?categoryId=10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Catalog products without categoryId: 400 problem details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/products

### Kitchen queue: 200 with the active orders oldest first for Kitchen or Manager, 401 without a token, 403 for a Waiter
# Sign in first (POST /api/v1/auth/login/pin) and paste the accessToken in the variable below
@accessToken = paste-the-access-token-here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/kitchen/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
